        "original_id": "6c4383e3-9159-5789-8b12-389744defd74",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Shayang County, Mengzhou, Maliang Town, Jingmen City, Hubei Province, Henan Province, Kaifeng, Jiaozuo\n- People: Liu Xiwu, Quan Wending, Wen Ding\n- Organizations: People's Republic of China\n- Historical states: Quan, Chu\n\nFacts:\n- Quan was founded by Quan Wending, a son of Wen Ding, in the area of modern Maliang Town in Shayang County, Jingmen City, Hubei Province, next to where the State of Chu later emerged.\n- Shayang County is a county in west-central Hubei Province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Mengzhou is a county-level city in Henan Province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Liu Xiwu was born in Meng County, Henan Province, which is modern Mengzhou in Jiaozuo, Henan Province, and he was educated in Kaifeng.",
